    <id>io.github.NezarAltarouti.Aleym</id>
    <name>Aleym Electron UI</name>
    <summary>Aggregate news</summary>
    <description>
        <p>Graphical user interface for Aleym, the highly extensible news aggregation system and knowledge-base. It prioritizes organization, efficiency, security, and privacy.</p>
        <p><em>Warning: The application didn't go through any prefessional security auditing, and the currently Tor support is reling on an old version of `Arti` due to some limitations that will be resolved as soon as possible, so it can't be trusted for sensitive use cases yet.</em></p>
        <p>Features:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Local first</li>
            <li>Multi-network anonymized fetching with support for builtin isolated Tor connections</li>
            <li>Privacy-reserving fetch scheduling without identifiable patterns</li>
            <li>AI-base summarization with Ollama (installed separately)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Supported standard feeds:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>RSS</li>
            <li>Atom</li>
            <li>Json</li>
        </ul>
    </description>
